WEBVTT

00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:31.000
va u meni yaralashdan to'xtamas

00:00:34.000 --> 00:00:38.000
yaralar qayta qayta azob beraveradi

00:00:38.000 --> 00:00:44.000
hayot esa bir chetda kutib turaveradi.

00:00:48.000 --> 00:00:51.000
Hammaning aytgani shu

00:00:54.000 --> 00:00:56.000
vaqt barin davolar derlar

00:01:00.000 --> 00:01:03.000
axir oramizdagi